#: video_xfields.py:29
msgid "Current position in the video."
msgstr "Videodagi hozirgi holat."

#: video_xfields.py:34
msgid ""
"Optional, for older browsers: the YouTube ID for the normal speed video."
msgstr ""
"Majburiy emas, eski brauzerlar uchun: oddiy tezlikdagi video uchun YouTube "
"ID."

#: video_xfields.py:35
msgid "YouTube ID"
msgstr "YouTube ID"

#: video_xfields.py:40
msgid "Optional, for older browsers: the YouTube ID for the .75x speed video."
msgstr ""
"Majburiy emas, eski brauzerlar uchun: .75x tezlikdagi video uchun YouTube "
"ID."

#: video_xfields.py:41
msgid "YouTube ID for .75x speed"
msgstr ".75x tezlik uchun YouTube ID"

#: video_xfields.py:46
msgid ""
"Optional, for older browsers: the YouTube ID for the 1.25x speed video."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, eski brauzerlar uchun: 1,25x tezlikdagi video uchun YouTube ID."

#: video_xfields.py:47
msgid "YouTube ID for 1.25x speed"
msgstr "1,25x tezlik uchun YouTube ID"

#: video_xfields.py:52
msgid "Optional, for older browsers: the YouTube ID for the 1.5x speed video."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, eski brauzerlar uchun: 1,5x tezlikdagi video uchun YouTube ID."

#: video_xfields.py:53
msgid "YouTube ID for 1.5x speed"
msgstr "1,5x tezlik uchun YouTube ID"

#: video_xfields.py:59
msgid ""
"Time you want the video to start if you don't want the entire video to play."
" Not supported in the native mobile app: the full video file will play. "
"Formatted as HH:MM:SS. The maximum value is 23:59:59."
msgstr ""
"Agar butun video ijro etilishini istamasangiz, videoni boshlash vaqti. "
"Mahalliy mobil ilovada qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi: to'liq video fayl o'ynaydi. "
"HH:MM:SS sifatida formatlangan. Maksimal qiymat 23:59:59."

#: video_xfields.py:63
msgid "Video Start Time"
msgstr "Video boshlanish vaqti"

#: video_xfields.py:69
msgid ""
"Time you want the video to stop if you don't want the entire video to play. "
"Not supported in the native mobile app: the full video file will play. "
"Formatted as HH:MM:SS. The maximum value is 23:59:59."
msgstr ""
"Agar butun videoni o'ynashni xohlamasangiz, video to'xtashini xohlagan vaqt."
" Mahalliy mobil ilovada qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi: to'liq video fayli ijro "
"etiladi. HH:MM:SS sifatida formatlangan. Maksimal qiymat 23:59:59."

#: video_xfields.py:73
msgid "Video Stop Time"
msgstr "Videoni to'xtatish vaqti"

#: video_xfields.py:81
msgid ""
"Allow students to download versions of this video in different formats if "
"they cannot use the edX video player or do not have access to YouTube. You "
"must add at least one non-YouTube URL in the Video File URLs field."
msgstr ""
"Talabalar edX video pleeridan foydalana olmasalar yoki YouTube-ga kirish "
"imkoniga ega bo'lmasalar, ushbu videoning turli formatdagi versiyalarini "
"yuklab olishlariga ruxsat bering. Video fayl URL manzillari maydoniga kamida"
" bitta YouTube bo'lmagan URL manzilini qo'shishingiz kerak."

#: video_xfields.py:85
msgid "Video Download Allowed"
msgstr "Video yuklab olish uchun ruxsat berilgan"

#: video_xfields.py:91
msgid ""
"The URL or URLs where you've posted non-YouTube versions of the video. Each "
"URL must end in .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg, or .webm and cannot be a YouTube URL. "
"(For browser compatibility, we strongly recommend .mp4 and .webm format.) "
"Students will be able to view the first listed video that's compatible with "
"the student's computer. To allow students to download these videos, set "
"Video Download Allowed to True."
msgstr ""
"Videoning YouTube boʻlmagan versiyalarini joylagan URL yoki URL manzillari. "
"Har bir URL manzili .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg yoki .webm bilan tugashi kerak va "
"YouTube URL manzili bo‘la olmaydi. (Brauzer mosligi uchun biz .mp4 va .webm "
"formatini tavsiya qilamiz.) Talabalar talabaning kompyuteriga mos keladigan "
"birinchi roʻyxatdagi videoni koʻrishlari mumkin boʻladi. Talabalarga ushbu "
"videolarni yuklab olishiga ruxsat berish uchun Videoni yuklab olish uchun "
"ruxsat berilgan rost deb belgilang."

#: video_xfields.py:97
msgid "Video File URLs"
msgstr "Video fayl URL manzillari"

#: video_xfields.py:102
msgid ""
"By default, students can download an .srt or .txt transcript when you set "
"Download Transcript Allowed to True. If you want to provide a downloadable "
"transcript in a different format, we recommend that you upload a handout by "
"using the Upload a Handout field. If this isn't possible, you can post a "
"transcript file on the Files & Uploads page or on the Internet, and then add"
" the URL for the transcript here. Students see a link to download that "
"transcript below the video."
msgstr ""
"Odatiy boʻlib, “Yuklab olish uchun ruxsat berilgan transkriptni rost” deb "
"belgilaganingizda, talabalar .srt yoki .txt transkriptini yuklab olishlari "
"mumkin. Agar siz boshqa formatda yuklab olinadigan transkriptni taqdim "
"qilmoqchi bo'lsangiz, tarqatma materialni yuklash maydonidan foydalanib "
"yuklashingizni tavsiya qilamiz. Agar buning iloji bo'lmasa, siz "
"transkripsiya faylini Fayllar va yuklamalar sahifasida yoki Internetda "
"joylashtirishingiz mumkin, so'ngra bu yerga transkripsiya URL manzilini "
"qo'shishingiz mumkin. Talabalar video ostidagi transkriptni yuklab olish "
"uchun havolani ko'rishadi."

#: video_xfields.py:108
msgid "Downloadable Transcript URL"
msgstr "Yuklab olinadigan transkript URL"

#: video_xfields.py:114
msgid ""
"Allow students to download the timed transcript. A link to download the file"
" appears below the video. By default, the transcript is an .srt or .txt "
"file. If you want to provide the transcript for download in a different "
"format, upload a file by using the Upload Handout field."
msgstr ""
"Talabalarga vaqtli transkriptni yuklab olishlariga ruxsat bering. Video "
"ostida faylni yuklab olish uchun havola paydo bo'ladi. Odatiy bo'lib, "
"transkript .srt yoki .txt faylidir. Agar siz boshqa formatda yuklab olish "
"uchun transkriptni taqdim qilmoqchi bo'lsangiz, \"Yuklash materiallarini "
"yuklash\" maydonidan foydalanib faylni yuklang."

#: video_xfields.py:118
msgid "Download Transcript Allowed"
msgstr "Transkriptni yuklab olish uchun ruxsat berilgan"

#: video_xfields.py:126
msgid ""
"The default transcript for the video, from the Default Timed Transcript "
"field on the Basic tab. This transcript should be in English. You don't have"
" to change this setting."
msgstr ""
"Video uchun standart transkript, Asosiy yorliqdagi Standart vaqtli "
"transkript maydonidan. Ushbu transkript ingliz tilida bo'lishi kerak. Bu "
"sozlamani oʻzgartirishingiz shart emas."

#: video_xfields.py:129
msgid "Default Timed Transcript"
msgstr "Standart vaqtli transkript"

#: video_xfields.py:134
msgid "Specify whether the transcripts appear with the video by default."
msgstr ""
"Transkriptlar sukut bo'yicha video bilan birga paydo bo'lishini belgilang."

#: video_xfields.py:135
msgid "Show Transcript"
msgstr "Transkriptni ko'rsatish"

#: video_xfields.py:142
msgid ""
"Add transcripts in different languages. Click below to specify a language "
"and upload an .srt transcript file for that language."
msgstr ""
"Turli tillardagi transkriptlarni qo'shing. Tilni belgilash va shu til uchun "
".srt transkript faylini yuklash uchun pastga bosing."

#: video_xfields.py:145
msgid "Transcript Languages"
msgstr "Transkripsiya tillari"

#: video_xfields.py:150
msgid "Preferred language for transcript."
msgstr "Transkript uchun afzal til."

#: video_xfields.py:151
msgid "Preferred language for transcript"
msgstr "Transkript uchun afzal til"

#: video_xfields.py:156
msgid "Transcript file format to download by user."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi tomonidan yuklab olinadigan transkript fayl formati."

#. Translators: This is a type of file used for captioning in the video
#. player.
#: video_xfields.py:160
msgid "SubRip (.srt) file"
msgstr "SubRip (.srt) fayli"

#: video_xfields.py:161
msgid "Text (.txt) file"
msgstr "Matn (.txt) fayli"

#: video_xfields.py:165
msgid "The last speed that the user specified for the video."
msgstr "Video uchun foydalanuvchi belgilagan oxirgi tezlik."

#: video_xfields.py:166
msgid "The default speed for the video."
msgstr "Video uchun standart tezlik."

#: video_xfields.py:168
msgid ""
"Specify whether to advance automatically to the next unit when the video "
"ends."
msgstr ""
"Video tugashi bilan avtomatik ravishda keyingi blokga oʻtish yoki oʻtishni "
"belgilang."

#: video_xfields.py:177
msgid "Specify whether YouTube is available for the user."
msgstr "YouTube foydalanuvchi uchun mavjudligini belgilang."

#: video_xfields.py:181
msgid ""
"Upload a handout to accompany this video. Students can download the handout "
"by clicking Download Handout under the video."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu videoga hamrohlik qilish uchun tarqatma materialni yuklang. Talabalar "
"tarqatma materialni video ostidagi “Yuklab olish” tugmasini bosish orqali "
"yuklab olishlari mumkin."

#: video_xfields.py:184
msgid "Upload Handout"
msgstr "Tarqatmani yuklash"

#: video_xfields.py:189
msgid ""
"Specify whether access to this video is limited to browsers only, or if it "
"can be accessed from other applications including mobile apps."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu videoga kirish faqat brauzerlar bilan chegaralanganligini yoki unga "
"boshqa ilovalar, jumladan, mobil ilovalar orqali kirish mumkinligini "
"belgilang."

#: video_xfields.py:192
msgid "Video Available on Web Only"
msgstr "Video faqat Internetda mavjud"

#: video_xfields.py:198
msgid ""
"If you were assigned a Video ID by edX for the video to play in this "
"component, enter the ID here. In this case, do not enter values in the "
"Default Video URL, the Video File URLs, and the YouTube ID fields. If you "
"were not assigned a Video ID, enter values in those other fields and ignore "
"this field."
msgstr ""
"Agar sizga ushbu komponentda videoni ijro etish uchun edX tomonidan Video "
"identifikatori berilgan bo‘lsa, identifikatorni shu yerga kiriting. Bunday "
"holda, standart video URL, Video fayl URL manzillari va YouTube ID "
"maydonlariga qiymatlarni kiritmang. Agar sizga video identifikatori "
"tayinlanmagan bo'lsa, boshqa maydonlarga qiymatlarni kiriting va bu maydonga"
" e'tibor bermang."

#: video_xfields.py:203
msgid "Video ID"
msgstr "Video identifikatori"

#: video_xfields.py:208
msgid "Date of the last view of the bumper"
msgstr "Bamperning oxirgi ko'rinishi sanasi"

#: video_xfields.py:212
msgid "Do not show bumper again"
msgstr "Yana bamperni ko'rsatmang"

#: video_xfields.py:217
msgid "Specify whether the video can be accessed publicly by learners."
msgstr ""
"Videoga o‘quvchilar tomonidan ochiq foydalanish mumkin yoki yo‘qligini "
"belgilang."

#: video_xfields.py:218
msgid "Public Access"
msgstr "Umumiy foydalanish imkoniyati"

#: video_xfields.py:225
msgid "Add a specific thumbnail for learners to see before playing the video."
msgstr ""
"Videoni o‘ynatishdan oldin o‘quvchilar ko‘rishlari uchun maxsus eskiz "
"qo‘shing."

#: video_xfields.py:226
msgid "Thumbnail"
msgstr "Eskiz"

