"Video pozitsiyasi. Ijro etishni almashtirish uchun bo‘sh joy tugmasini "
"bosing"

#: assets/js/src/06_video_progress_slider.js:299
msgid "Video ended"
msgstr "Video tugadi"

#: assets/js/src/06_video_progress_slider.js:303
